<title>USA: GOLF-THIRD ROUND LEADERS AT NISSAN OPEN.</title>
<headline>GOLF-THIRD ROUND LEADERS AT NISSAN OPEN.</headline>
<dateline>PACIFIC PALISADES, California 1997-03-01</dateline>
<text>
