<p>tournament on Saturday (players U.S. unless stated):</p>
<p>204 Nick Faldo (Britain) 66 70 68</p>
<p>205 Scott McCarron 68 73 64, Craig Stadler 71 66 68</p>
<p>207 Tom Purtzer 67 71 69, Scott Hoch 65 71 71</p>
<p>208 Robin Freeman 69 71 68, Fred Couples 68 70 70, Mark</p>
<p>O'Meara 67 69 72</p>
